y has 75 years of record on its 6 grids, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, June to July and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 36 years. In 2025, July to August came in at 46% and November to December at 41% on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 48% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
